<Base title="Privacy information" description="How the current Nordiska website handles enquiry information."><main id="top"><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Privacy</div><h1>Privacy information.</h1><p>Your information deserves clear, responsible handling.</p></div></section><section class="content"><div class="wrap privacy-copy"><p>This page describes the current website implementation. A full privacy notice for online enquiries will be provided when Nordiska’s enquiry channel is connected.</p><h2>Enquiry information</h2><p>The enquiry form prepares a text file on your device. It does not send your details to Nordiska or save them in a website database. You decide how to share the downloaded file.</p><h2>Information you choose to enter</h2><p>You may provide your name, company, work email, technology or project details, target market and enquiry. Please include only the information needed to explain your business opportunity.</p><h2>External images and fonts</h2><p>This website loads photography, a map and fonts from external providers, including Unsplash, Wikimedia Commons and Google Fonts. Your browser connects to these providers when their assets load, which can disclose your IP address and browser request information.</p><h2>Cookies and browser storage</h2><p>The application does not set analytics or marketing cookies and does not save enquiry information in browser storage. Your selected service, industry or location can be passed to the contact page through its URL.</p><h2>Before online enquiries launch</h2><p>The responsible contact, purpose and basis for processing, retention period, recipients and request procedures will be set out in the approved privacy notice before online submission is enabled.</p><a class="link" href={withBase('/contact/')}>Return to your enquiry<span>→</span></a></div></section></main></Base>
